ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap
    ethernet.ipv6.sctp.f1ap.F1AP-PDU.initiatingMessage.value.UEContextModificationRequest.protocolIEs.Item 2.ProtocolIE-Field.value.CUtoDURRCInformation.cG-ConfigInfo.CG-ConfigInfo.criticalExtensions.c1.cg-ConfigInfo.configRestrictInfo.allowedBC-ListMRDC = 4 items

